#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/romfs.rst:2
msgid "Editing the ROM file system"
msgstr "Mengedit sistem file ROM"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/romfs.rst:4
msgid ""
"Boards with ROMFS support carry a read-only file system in flash, mounted on"
" the camera at ``/rom``. It ships with the board's default machine-learning "
"models, and it is where a product's models and assets belong: files in ROMFS"
" are memory-mapped straight out of flash, so a large model loads without "
"consuming RAM for a copy. The IDE's Tools → ROM File System submenu is the "
"editor for it."
msgstr ""
"Board dengan dukungan ROMFS membawa sistem file hanya-baca di flash, "
"dipasang di kamera pada ``/rom``\\ . Board ini dikirim dengan model machine "
"learning default board, dan di sinilah model dan aset produk berada: file di"
" ROMFS dipetakan langsung dari flash ke memori, sehingga model besar dapat "
"dimuat tanpa mengkonsumsi RAM untuk salinan. Submenu Tools → ROM File System"
" IDE adalah editor untuk itu."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/romfs.rst:14
msgid "The editor"
msgstr "Editor"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/romfs.rst:16
msgid ""
"Edit ROMFS on OpenMV Cam reads the connected camera's ROMFS and opens it in "
"the editor: a file tree plus buttons to add files, create folders, delete "
"and extract entries, and pull a model straight in from the :doc:`model zoo "
"<model-zoo>`. A usage readout tracks how much of the board's ROMFS partition"
" the contents occupy. Nothing touches the camera until you press *Commit*, "
"which asks whether to write the result back to the camera or save it to a "
"``.img`` file on disk."
msgstr ""
"Edit ROMFS on OpenMV Cam membaca ROMFS kamera yang terhubung dan membukanya "
"di editor: pohon file ditambah tombol untuk menambah file, membuat folder, "
"menghapus dan mengekstrak entri, serta menarik model langsung dari "
":doc:`model zoo <model-zoo>`\\ . Pembacaan penggunaan melacak seberapa "
"banyak partisi ROMFS board yang ditempati oleh konten. Tidak ada yang "
"menyentuh kamera hingga Anda menekan *Commit*\\ , yang menanyakan apakah "
"akan menulis hasilnya kembali ke kamera atau menyimpannya ke file ``.img`` "
"di disk."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/romfs.rst:26
msgid ""
"Two conversions happen automatically as you add files. A ``.py`` script is "
"cross-compiled to ``.mpy`` bytecode for the target board, and a model file "
"is converted for the board's NPU accelerator when it has one and the model "
"needs it. What lands in ROMFS is always the form the camera executes "
"directly. Files dragged in from your file manager go through the same "
"conversions, into the folder you drop them on -- or the root when you drop "
"on empty space."
msgstr ""
"Dua konversi terjadi secara otomatis saat Anda menambahkan file. Skrip "
"``.py`` dikompilasi silang ke bytecode ``.mpy`` untuk papan target, dan file"
" model dikonversi untuk akselerator NPU papan jika papan memilikinya dan "
"model memerlukannya. Yang masuk ke ROMFS selalu dalam bentuk yang langsung "
"dieksekusi oleh kamera. File yang diseret dari pengelola file Anda melewati "
"konversi yang sama, ke dalam folder tempat Anda menjatuhkannya -- atau ke "
"root saat Anda menjatuhkannya di ruang kosong."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/romfs.rst:36
msgid ""
"The Edit ROMFS dialog: a file tree of model and label files, the usage "
"readout, and the Commit, Model Zoo, Add File, New Folder, Delete, and "
"Extract File buttons"
msgstr ""
"Dialog Edit ROMFS: pohon file dari model dan file label, pembacaan "
"penggunaan, serta tombol Commit, Model Zoo, Add File, New Folder, Delete, "
"dan Extract File"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/romfs.rst:36
msgid ".. image:: figures/romfs-editor.png"
msgstr ".. image:: figures/romfs-editor.png"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/romfs.rst:40
msgid ""
"The Edit ROMFS dialog showing a board's default contents -- its machine-"
"learning models -- with the usage readout at the bottom right."
msgstr ""
"Dialog Edit ROMFS menampilkan konten default board -- model machine "
"learning-nya -- dengan pembacaan penggunaan di kanan bawah."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/romfs.rst:44
msgid ""
"Open ROMFS File runs the same editor against a ``.img`` image file on disk "
"instead of a connected camera, and New ROMFS File starts it empty -- either "
"way, the path to preparing a ROMFS image offline, for flashing in production"
" or shipping alongside a custom firmware build. Reset ROMFS on OpenMV Cam "
"restores the connected camera's ROMFS to the board's defaults, undoing all "
"edits."
msgstr ""
"Open ROMFS File menjalankan editor yang sama terhadap file image ``.img`` di"
" disk alih-alih kamera yang terhubung, dan New ROMFS File memulainya kosong "
"-- apa pun, jalur untuk mempersiapkan image ROMFS secara offline, untuk di-"
"flash dalam produksi atau dikirim bersama build firmware kustom. Reset ROMFS"
" on OpenMV Cam mengembalikan ROMFS kamera yang terhubung ke default board, "
"membatalkan semua pengeditan."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/romfs.rst:53
msgid ""
"Reading and writing the camera's ROMFS goes through its bootloader, with a "
"progress dialog you can cancel. Cancelling a read simply abandons it; "
"cancelling a write leaves the ROMFS partially written, so run Reset ROMFS or"
" commit again before relying on it. Either way the IDE asks the bootloader "
"to restart the camera and waits for it to come back -- and if the camera "
"stays in bootloader mode instead, it says so, and the bootloader dialog on "
"the next connect offers the same reset and edit actions."
msgstr ""
"Membaca dan menulis ROMFS kamera berlangsung melalui bootloader-nya, dengan "
"dialog kemajuan yang dapat Anda batalkan. Membatalkan pembacaan hanya "
"meninggalkannya; membatalkan penulisan meninggalkan ROMFS yang tertulis "
"sebagian, jadi jalankan Reset ROMFS atau lakukan commit lagi sebelum "
"mengandalkannya. Bagaimanapun, IDE meminta bootloader untuk memulai ulang "
"kamera dan menunggunya kembali -- dan jika kamera justru tetap berada dalam "
"mode bootloader, IDE mengatakannya, dan dialog bootloader pada koneksi "
"berikutnya menawarkan aksi reset dan edit yang sama."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/romfs.rst:66
msgid ""
":doc:`../../production/shipping/romfs-image` for ROMFS's role in shipping an"
" application -- what to put there, and how the camera reads it at runtime."
msgstr ""
":doc:`../../production/shipping/romfs-image` untuk peran ROMFS dalam "
"pengiriman aplikasi -- apa yang harus diletakkan di sana, dan bagaimana "
"kamera membacanya saat runtime."
